clear
units lj
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

variable ncycle equal 864
variable nsweeps equal 60
variable seed equal 24681357
variable tmc equal 1.0

lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 6 0 6 0 6 units lattice
create_box 3 box
create_atoms 1 box
region slab2 block INF INF INF INF 2 4 units lattice
region slab3 block INF INF INF INF 4 INF units lattice
set region slab2 type 2
set region slab3 type 3
mass 1 1
mass 2 1
mass 3 1

pair_style lj/cut 2.4
pair_coeff 1 1 0.890000 0.940000 2.400000
pair_coeff 1 2 0.930000 0.955000 2.400000
pair_coeff 1 3 0.970000 0.970000 2.400000
pair_coeff 2 2 1.000000 0.980000 2.400000
pair_coeff 2 3 1.040000 0.995000 2.400000
pair_coeff 3 3 1.110000 1.020000 2.400000

neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.0
fix int all nve

compute ctype all count/type atom
fix mc all atom/swap 1 ${ncycle} ${seed} ${tmc} ke no semi-grand yes types 1 2 3 mu 0 0.18 -0.12
thermo 5
thermo_modify format float %.17g
thermo_style custom step pe c_ctype[1] c_ctype[2] c_ctype[3] f_mc[1] f_mc[2]
run ${nsweeps}

write_data results/exact__ternary_lj_cut__atom.data nocoeff
